# Test artifacts
*.test
*.out
test_*
!tests/
# `test_*` (meant for binary artifacts) also matches SOURCE files named
# tests/test_*.zig — `!tests/` only un-ignores the directory itself, not the
# files inside it. This silently swallowed tests/test_edge_existence_index.zig
# from the Phase 3 commit (GAP 0031(b)). Re-include Zig test sources.
!tests/test_*.zig

